## ISH and NISH

Once Hatr is live we are one step closer to removing the ISH and NISH.

Before this can be done though, the following services will need to be moved:

| **Data Service Host** | **Service** | **Notes** |
| --- | --- | --- |
| ISH | EnumerationReferenceDataService | Can be moved to UI project. |
| ISH | MembershipDataService | Can be moved to UI project. |
| ISH | CacheDataService | No longer be needed. |
| ISH | SearchQueueJobProcessor | Replaced by Hatr |
| NISH | JobGovernor | Replaced by Hatr |
| NISH | JobProcessor x 3 | Replaced by Hatr |
| NISH | CacheDataService | No longer be needed. |
| NISH | ServiceBusDataService | Used by logging queue, soon to be deprecated with NewRelic logs |

## Yadl and Disco

Yadl and Disco, our data load and database maintenance jobs, should not be implemented as Hatr tasks as it does not makes scenes for these to be running in Azure. Instead these will need to be extract into their own Docker container and may require their a new management UI. 

